---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for Chinese Mountains — how we handle your data and what we don't collect.">
<section class="pt-12 pb-20">
<div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6" style="max-width:48rem">
<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 text-sm">Last updated: August 4, 2026</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">What We Collect</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed"><strong>We don't collect much.</strong> Chinese Mountains is a static website. We do not use cookies, we do not run advertisements, and we do not have user accounts. Here's what we do collect:</p>
<ul class="space-y-2 mt-3 text-slate-600">
<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&bull;</span><strong>Email (if you contact us):</strong> If you email us at hello@chinesemountains.org, we receive your email address and whatever information you include in your message. We use this only to reply to you and never share it with anyone.</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">We load two third-party resources on our pages:</p>
<ul class="space-y-2 mt-3 text-slate-600">
<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&bull;</span><strong>Geist font (via jsDelivr CDN):</strong> For typography. jsDelivr may log your IP address and browser information as part of standard CDN operation.</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-accent mt-1 shrink-0">&bull;</span><strong>Leaflet (via cdnjs):</strong> For our interactive maps. cdnjs may log standard request data in server logs.</li>
</ul>
<p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">We do not use Google Analytics, Facebook Pixel, or any other tracking scripts. We have no idea who you are unless you tell us.</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">Your Rights</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Since we store no personal data (except emails you voluntarily send us), there's not much to exercise rights over. If you've emailed us and want your correspondence deleted, just reply and ask — we'll delete it immediately.</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">If we ever add analytics, advertising, or user accounts, we'll update this page and note the changes clearly. The current version will always be at this URL.</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">Contact</h2>
<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:hello@chinesemountains.org" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">hello@chinesemountains.org</a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
